  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "**Issue:**\n\nUsing Udon Sharp's `VRCStringDownloader.LoadUrl()` to attempt to download a text file larger than [String Loading](https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/string-loading)'s maximum file size restriction of 100 MB triggers `OnStringLoadError()` with the HTTP error code [200 OK](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Status/200) and the message `Unable to write data.`.\n\n**Suggestion:**\n\nI think it should be changed to the HTTP error code [413 Content Too Large](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Status/413) and the message `Text file is too large.` to make it clearer, since 200 OK is meant to be used for successful responses.",
